Description: AlloMate is a Shiny web application developed by the Breeding Insight team to support genetic mate allocation and breeding optimization. The app integrates pedigree-based kinship, estimated breeding values (EBVs), and Optimum Contribution Selection (OCS) to help breeding programs balance genetic gain while controlling inbreeding.
